================================================================================
Credits and provenance
================================================================================

This repository builds on the work of others:

  Adam Yung and contributors      https://github.com/Adam-Yung/Crush80_ZMK
    The original ZMK port of the Crush 80: board definition, build, install and
    update scripts, keymaps, the first USB/BLE bring-up. This repository is a
    fork of it (history preserved). The upstream repository carries no license
    file; its authors retain copyright in their contributions.

  scholzri                        https://github.com/scholzri/rainy75-zmk
    ZMK port and reverse engineering of the sibling Wobkey Rainy 75 Pro (same
    Telink TLSR9511 platform): the B91 USB, Bluetooth, WS2812 LED-strip,
    battery and watchdog drivers, the rainy_rgb lighting engine, the flash
    management group and the upstream patches. Apache-2.0.

